Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:18:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Controller setup: read the focused binding box from the
 active window

The XInput, DirectInput and RawInput listeners looked up the focused text
box in Application.Current.Windows[0]. That is not always the main
window: the debugger's XAML tooling and first-run windows can come
first, and then every button press was silently dropped. They now use
the active window, or the main window when none is active.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xkm42Nb8k8qCUfB5RCiVU3
