 .../Helpers/JoystickControlDirectInput.cs       |  2 +-
 .../Helpers/JoystickControlRawInput.cs          |  4 ++--
 TeknoParrotUi/Helpers/JoystickControlXInput.cs  |  2 +-
 TeknoParrotUi/TeknoParrotUi.csproj              |  1 +
